<main id="top"><section class="hero"><div class="hero-copy-block reveal"><div class="eyebrow"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle"></i> The modern work operating system</div><h1>Bring your people, work and <em>momentum</em> together.</h1><p class="hero-copy">TeamConnect gives every employee one focused place to chat, manage daily work and stay aligned — with the right experience for employees, managers, HR and administrators.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="btn primary" href="<%= contextPath %>/views/register.jsp">Start connecting <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></a><a class="btn" href="#platform"><i class="fa-regular fa-circle-play"></i> Explore platform</a></div><div class="hero-note"><div class="avatar-stack"><b>AS</b><b>RK</b><b>MN</b></div><span><strong>Built for teams that move fast</strong><br><i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i> Secure by design · ready for every workday</span></div></div>
